## Hub commands

Run these from any directory on this host.

```sh
cockpit runs show {{.RunID}}
cockpit runs exec {{.RunID}} -- <flow>
cockpit runs stop {{.RunID}}
cockpit runs resume {{.RunID}}
cockpit runs destroy {{.RunID}}
```

`cockpit runs exec` runs one flow again inside the environment of this run while it is up. Put an id from the last section in place of `<flow>`.

